{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/201b4b5c766cc38d0462ec137a5c59f5.avif?t=1756628366\" width=1481 height=154 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highrise features a cast of four unique characters to smash and crash through the baron's fortress with. Each character has been designed with style and substance in mind, giving them a killer aesthetic and satisfying move set that embodies their personalities. Who will you pick?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/018fed0b79428e929001d9d680bfb11a.poster.avif?t=1756628366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/018fed0b79428e929001d9d680bfb11a.webm?t=1756628366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/018fed0b79428e929001d9d680bfb11a.mp4?t=1756628366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/5e42633b17720fbe239d41ea8927eeab.avif?t=1756628366\" width=1481 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highrise allows you and up to three other players locally to crush hordes of the Baron's militia. Play through the whole game together, combine your skills, and most importantly, look good while doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/6b01da2c62530f0a64198f2ea965d939.poster.avif?t=1756628366\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/6b01da2c62530f0a64198f2ea965d939.webm?t=1756628366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/66a5317109dc59608ad888dd4c0f3e0e.avif?t=1756628366\" width=1481 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every good dethroning of a tyrannical leader needs a killer soundtrack, right? Highrise features a dynamic music system that reacts to which characters have been selected, with each character having their own instrument. How will you orchestrate the Baron\u2019s downfall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/19b668cd75f9756e8f510a6ee872386d.poster.avif?t=1756628366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/19b668cd75f9756e8f510a6ee872386d.webm?t=1756628366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/19b668cd75f9756e8f510a6ee872386d.mp4?t=1756628366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>       <br>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/a57f6d7f92b8a62d5b4b514edc1988b8.avif?t=1756628366\" width=1481 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highrise features the \u201cAmped up\u201d system. This system rewards player synergy and precision by increasing the player's ultimate recharge rate on hit, the more damage they do without getting hit. Play good, feel good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/d063df02379f149ef4dac3b4fc5ce7ef.poster.avif?t=1756628366\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/d063df02379f149ef4dac3b4fc5ce7ef.webm?t=1756628366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/7bce14aea7ffaac7a1d0f5ba9a48097d.avif?t=1756628366\" width=1481 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to squash some beef? Not to worry, battle and compete against your friends in a variety of unique maps in our PVP mode and determine who\u2019s best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/b0f0e6898ad375713017285f5295c6f8.poster.avif?t=1756628366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/b0f0e6898ad375713017285f5295c6f8.webm?t=1756628366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/extras/b0f0e6898ad375713017285f5295c6f8.mp4?t=1756628366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857230?t=1756628366","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/d6754ce6800977602029841d82c1b4681cb94ad1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756628366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857230/5d